@startuml
' Class 7.3 Enrollment wajah (F-03) — docs/proposal/07-data-dan-class.md
class FaceTemplate {
  +UUID student_id
  +UUID enrollment_batch_id
  +int embedding_dimension
  +String model_name
  +String model_version
  +JSON quality_metadata
  +UUID created_by_user_id
  +DateTime revoked_at
  +UUID revoked_by_user_id
  +revoke()
}
class Student {
  +String student_number
  +String full_name
}
class User {
  +UUID id
  +String full_name
}
Student "1" -- "*" FaceTemplate : maks 5 aktif
User "1" -- "0..*" FaceTemplate : dibuat/mencabut (nullable)

note bottom of FaceTemplate
  Embedding tersimpan terenkripsi (AES-256-GCM)
  beserta model name/version wajib; tanpa raw image.
  Batas 5 template aktif/siswa (MAX_STORED_TEMPLATES).
end note
@enduml
